/*!
\page page_stcalibrationvertex StCalibrationVertex

\brief Concrete vertex sub-class for calibration and diagnostic vertices (no daughters or parent).

\section stcalibrationvertex_overview Overview
StCalibrationVertex stores positions and covariances for vertices
produced by calibration procedures (e.g., FTPC laser tracks, cosmic
crossings).  It has no daughter tracks and no parent track.

Calibration vertices are stored in StEvent::calVertices().

\section stcalibrationvertex_hierarchy Class Hierarchy
\code{.cpp}
TObject → StObject → StMeasuredPoint → StVertex → StCalibrationVertex
\endcode

\section stcalibrationvertex_types Calibration Types
- kFtpcEastCalibrationVertexId (6): FTPC east laser calibration
- kFtpcWestCalibrationVertexId (7): FTPC west laser calibration

\section stcalibrationvertex_methods Key Methods

\code{.cpp}
const StSPtrVecCalibrationVertex& cv = event->calVertices();
for (size_t i = 0; i < cv.size(); ++i) {
    if (cv[i]->type() != kFtpcEastCalibrationVertexId) continue;
    StThreeVectorF pos = cv[i]->position();
    float chi2 = cv[i]->chiSquared();
}
\endcode

\sa \ref page_stvertex
*/
